// Every action authenticates the caller and resolves ONLY a mailbox they own via
// `resolveMailbox` (which also performs the ownership check used everywhere else
// in the mail client). Writes are rate-limited and return a friendly
// `{ ok, error }`. Anything that changes mail ROUTING — aliases, forwarding,
// auto-reply — additionally requires the target domain to be on a VERIFIED
// subscription owned by the caller before touching Mailcow.
//
